          },
          "text": "This Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of March 3, 2026 (the\r\n\"Effective Date\"), by and between Northwind Robotics, Inc., a Delaware corporation with offices at\r\n200 Innovation Way, Austin, TX 78701 (\"Party A\"), and Blue Harbor Analytics LLC, a California limited\r\nliability company with offices at 55 Market Street, San Francisco, CA 94105 (\"Party B\")."
