            "fontName": "Helvetica",
            "fontSubset": true,
            "fontWeight": 0,
            "fontSize": 10.5
          },
          "text": "The parties wish to explore a potential business relationship concerning predictive maintenance\r\nanalytics for industrial robotics (the \"Purpose\"), and in connection with the Purpose, each party may\r\ndisclose certain confidential technical and business information to the other."
        },
