            "fontMonospaced": false,
            "fontName": "Helvetica",
            "fontSubset": true,
            "fontWeight": 0,
            "fontSize": 10.5
          },
          "text": "This Agreement shall remain in effect for a period of twenty-four (24) months from the Effective Date,\r\nexpiring on March 3, 2028 (the \"Expiration Date\"), unless earlier terminated as provided herein.\r\nFollowing the Expiration Date, this Agreement shall automatically renew for successive twelve (12)\r\nmonth periods unless either party provides written notice of non-renewal at least sixty (60) days prior\r\nto the end of the then-current term."
        },
